  "notes": "{高|たか}める is a transitive ichidan verb meaning to raise, elevate, or enhance.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{高|たか}まる→高まる：02066_takamaru⟧ (intransitive, to rise/increase)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{高|たか}めて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates an ongoing effort to improve or elevate something.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{能力|のうりょく}→能力：03541_nouryoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{高|たか}める: to improve abilities\n- ⟦{技術|ぎじゅつ}→技術：01389_gijutsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{高|たか}める: to enhance skills\n- ⟦{質|しつ}→質：01425_shitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{高|たか}める: to improve quality\n- ⟦{効率|こうりつ}→効率：11794_kouritsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{高|たか}める: to increase efficiency\n- ⟦{意識|いしき}→意識：01714_ishiki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{高|たか}める: to raise awareness\n- ⟦{士気|しき}→士気：19824_shiki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{高|たか}める: to boost morale\n- ⟦{声|こえ}→声：02207_koe⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{高|たか}める: to raise one's voice\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used in business and self-improvement contexts. The pair ⟦{高|たか}まる→高まる：02066_takamaru⟧ describes something rising on its own: ⟦{期待|きたい}→期待：00238_kitai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{高|たか}まる→高まる：02066_takamaru⟧ (expectations rise).",
